id: pm-gh1560
title: "GH-1560: retain extension flag defaults in help and runtime contracts"
description: "Reported on2026.10.23: declared extension flag defaults apply during execution but disappear from text/machine help and runtime contracts/schema, despite the public FlagDefinition promise. Investigate discovery metadata preservation without executing mutating commands to learn defaults."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
