acceptance_criteria: "Text and JSON command help, flag contracts and command-scoped runtime schema disclose declared extension defaults with their original value types; omitted-flag execution returns the same defaults; discovery does not require invoking the extension command; sandboxed regressions cover string, numeric and falsy defaults."
parent: pm-ltbr
risk: medium
confidence: medium
resolution: "Preserve original extension defaults in text help, JSON help default_value, runtime flag contracts and command JSON Schema; keep explicit list parsing unchanged."
expected_result: "Authors and agents can discover declared defaults without executing the handler, including numeric0, false, empty strings and arrays."
actual_result: "62 linked tests pass, including installed extension discovery with no handler dispatch and explicit list overrides; typecheck and finalized SDK snapshot checks pass. Pre-fix negative control fails as intended."
