  "2026-10-24T04:51:31.491Z","harness:codex","Implementation scope: preserve declared defaults across Commander help, runtime flag contracts and command schema without executing extension handlers. Grouped with pm-gh1561 to make SDK-authored defaults observable and lossless. Intake: complete strict 3092-item all-status receipt, no omitted/unreadable rows; both current histories verify and closed parents remain completed. GitHub audit: zero open PRs and zero Dependabot/code/secret alerts."
